# SharedInbox

- Packing dual-writes `DTF Des-P*.xlsx` into `runtime/SharedInbox/DTF Des/{date}/{shift}/` when **Make design queues** is enabled.
- Packing sync-invokes Queue `design_queues_watcher.py --files` after Excel and **before** PDFs (waits). Prefer SharedInbox copies so they move to `Processed/`.
- Continuous Design Queues watcher still runs for late/manual drops (Packing starts it on launch via `shared/design_queues_watcher.py`).
- Skip Batches (Configuration Workbook sheet): matching batch digits skip queue PNGs; inbox file still moves to `Processed/`.
- Headless save also copies PNGs to the configured DTF Queues folder when set.
- Path helper: `shared.paths.shared_inbox_dtf_des_root()`.
- Do not delete live inbox files while packing or the watcher may be writing.
- Shipping does not auto-read this folder yet.
